{"skill":{"slug":"tiktok-scraper","displayName":"TikTok Scraper"},"version":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1788361595153,"changelog":"- Initial release of tiktok-scraper skill.\n- Provides high-speed TikTok scraping via the Apify API (paid account required).\n- Supports videos, profiles, hashtags, music, comments, and location-based posts with four specialized actors.\n- Detailed usage examples for scraping user profiles, hashtags, sounds, keywords, comments, and geotagged posts.\n- Returns structured JSON objects for posts and comments, supporting both sync and async workflows.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":9222,"sha256":"fa1a269450c7719090ace2d80233127574fcb570430f6fa570513f4fdd9e5413","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2393,"sha256":"1c58fa82f5d94484f4d58a755f04c017ed0a7780ec859906bdd41e4512cd4d96","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1788410242074,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"01dcd4460d837b692f8d753adf41d289e419324dc6f3be69543e498c2acd51b6","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/01dcd4460d837b692f8d753adf41d289e419324dc6f3be69543e498c2acd51b6","scanners":{"vt":null,"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":19,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":7,"checkedAt":1788410242074},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a user-directed TikTok scraping guide, but it enables broad collection of profiles, comments, and location-linked content without privacy or acceptable-use guardrails.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Use of Apify's external API, an Apify bearer token, and a paid account is clearly disclosed and proportionate to the scraping purpose, but users should understand they are sending scrape jobs and receiving scraped data through a third-party service.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact is a single Markdown skill with no executable install hooks. Optional pip and npm client-library installs are disclosed for code integration.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The commands are explicit and user-invoked, but the examples encourage bulk collection, including multi-profile, comment-thread, and multi-city runs, with no scoping limits beyond item counts.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"There is no local persistence, privilege escalation, or background local worker. The async examples create remote Apify actor runs and datasets that may persist according to Apify account settings.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is coherent: it documents Apify actors for scraping TikTok posts, profiles, comments, and location feeds. The concern is that those capabilities can collect user metadata, comments, replies, and location-linked posts at scale without guidance on privacy, consent, retention, or lawful use.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Review before installing if you plan to use it beyond narrow, lawful, user-directed scraping. Treat collected TikTok comments, profile metadata, and location-linked posts as potentially personal data, minimize what you collect, and verify TikTok, Apify, and applicable privacy-law requirements before running bulk jobs.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: The scanner's concern is supported in part: scraping TikTok profiles, comments, replies, and location-based posts is the skill's stated purpose, but the artifact does not provide privacy, consent, retention, or acceptable-use guidance for that social data collection.\n[E1] expected: The external transmissions are calls to Apify's documented API using the user's APIFY_TOKEN and are necessary for the skill's core function; I did not find hidden exfiltration or unrelated destinations.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1788410242074}}}}}